{"agency_id": "climate-change-commission", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eNJR2tznHQk", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:47:48+00:00", "content": "Webinar: Aotearoa NZ's emissions reduction target and emissions budgets\n\nWe're currently asking for public feedback on three pieces of work related to Aotearoa New Zealand’s 2050 emissions reduction target and the next emissions budget. In this webinar, we provide an overview of this consultation, followed by breakout sessions on each of the three projects, and ending with Q&amp;A.\n\nLearn more about these projects and this consultation: https://www.climatecommission.govt.nz/news/have-your-say-how-can-aotearoa-new-zealand-best-tackle-greenhouse-gases/\n\nMake a submission here: https://haveyoursay.climatecommission.govt.nz/\n\nFollow us on Eventbrite to hear about upcoming webinars and events: https://www.eventbrite.co.nz/o/climate-change-commission-29793944859\n\n00:00 Welcome\n01:22 Overview of the Commission\n04:22 Overview of this consultation\n13:00 Introducing breakout sessions\n14:26 Session 1: What should the level of the fourth emissions budget be?\n42:38 Session 2: Does NZ's 2050 emissions target need to change?\n1:09:18 Session 3: Should emissions from international shipping and aviation be included in the 2050 target?\n1:33:30 Q&A", "content_hash": "4d6148aeb548ee69c1db5743ffe1b811b56267f4613937bca480c53eff96bc17", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ", "source_id": "climate-change-commission-youtube-ac260476", "video_id": "eNJR2tznHQk"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2024-05-24T03:13:11+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2024-05\\bcc77ca5e114682ddded5130.json", "record_id": "youtube:bcc77ca5e114682ddded5130", "source_account": "UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ"}
